---
import HomeImage from "../assets/homeImage.png"
import AwardCardComponent from "./AwardCardComponent.astro"
import MeetTheTeamComponent from "./MeetTheTeamComponent.astro"
---


<div class="aboutus-root w-full relative">

    <div class="info flex flex-col lg:flex-row px-8 flex-wrap mt-4">
        <div class="info-text sm:w-full  lg:w-1/2 order-2 lg:order-1 flex justify-center items-center px-3">
            <p class="py-8">
                We envision a future where military personnel 
                are exceptionally prepared to face any 
                challenge with confidence and competence. 
                By providing innovative training solutions, 
                we aim to enhance mission readiness and 
                operational effectiveness across all 
                branches of the military.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="info-img sm:w-full lg:w-1/2 flex justify-center order-1 lg:order-2">
            <img src={HomeImage.src} alt="" class="w-72">
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-mission mt-4" id="about-mission">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 ml-5 mt-5 justify-start">
            <div class="h-px w-20 bg-orange-800"></div>
            <span class="font-extrabold text-orange-800 text-2xl italic">MISSION</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-mission-text px-16 my-16">
            At Gurukul Education, inspired by the ancient Indian Gurukul tradition, our mission is to provide comprehensive and experiential training for government defense careers, children’s adventure and life skills, and school-based programs. We strive to instill discipline, resilience, and leadership while nurturing intellectual, physical, and emotional growth. Our goal is to empower learners to face challenges with confidence and serve society with integrity and purpose.
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-vision mt-4 py-8" style="background-color:rgba(174, 68, 90, 0.5);">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mr-5 mt-5 justify-end">
            <div class="h-px w-20 bg-orange-800"></div>
            <span class="font-extrabold text-orange-800 text-2xl italic">VISION</span>
        </div>
        <div class="about-vision-text px-16 my-16">
           
            To be a leading institution that revives the essence of the Gurukul system, blending traditional values with modern expertise. Gurukul Education envisions a future where every individual is equipped with the strength, wisdom, and confidence to excel in defense, education, and life’s challenges, shaping a nation of empowered, disciplined, and service-oriented citizens."

            Both statements honor the spirit of the Gurukul, which emphasizes holistic development, discipline, and values while integrating them into a modern, specialized training framework.        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-awards-section w-full  relative -top-16 p-8 flex flex-wrap flex-row justify-between" id="about-awards-section">
        <AwardCardComponent title="Achievemnt" desc="1100 people recruited as soldier in arm force , police force"/>
        <AwardCardComponent title="Achievemnt" desc="10000 school students trained annually"/>
        <AwardCardComponent title="Achievemnt" desc="Partnerd with over 38 schools to deliver impactful summer camps and training programs"/>
        <AwardCardComponent title="Achievemnt" desc="Our 4-acre campus is fully equipped with modern amenities and advanced military training equipment."/>
    </div>

    <div class="meet-the-team" id="meet-the-team">
        <MeetTheTeamComponent/>
    </div>
</div>